+ * USB4 DisplayPort tunneling bring-up hook (Surface Laptop 8 experiments):
+ * "on [rate_khz] [lanes]" initializes the DP PHY in tunneled mode, runs the
+ * link and DP IN clocks and points the MDSS DP IN mux at this controller;
